& [ProfileContract] is version exact
  + [request_profile_0_2] requires result profile 0.3
  + [result_profile_0_3] has five outcomes
  + [runtime_profile_0_2] releases result profile 0.3 only
  + [request_0_1] rejects in the replacement runtime
  + [result_0_2] rejects as a current result
  + [historical_files] remain immutable evidence

& [FaultContract] is retained
  + [OpenFault] is actual CreateFileW failure with nonzero immediate OS error
  + [QueryFault] is actual named query failure with nonzero immediate OS error
  + [ObservationFault] is returned-length, invalid-UTF16, or invalid-observation local rejection
  + [runtime_provenance_fault] retains invalid request, unsupported target, and zero-error operation
  + [partial_evidence] is absent

& [CompleteLocalContract] is one closed product
  + [fields] are profile, target, root, StrongFileIdentity, canonical root volume-GUID path, WindowsVolumeInformation, and disposition
  + [remote_protocol] is structurally absent
  + [EligibleLocalNtfs] requires exact filesystem name NTFS
  + [RejectUnsupportedFileSystem] requires any other admitted filesystem name
  + [RejectRemoteProtocol] is forbidden

& [CompleteRemoteContract] is one closed product
  + [fields] are profile, target, root, StrongFileIdentity, WindowsRemoteProtocolInformation, and disposition
  + [volume_GUID_path] is structurally absent
  + [volume_information] is structurally absent
  + [protocol] must be nonzero
  + [disposition] must be RejectRemoteProtocol

& [RuntimeControlFlowContract] is exact
  + [common_1] validate request before effects
  + [common_2] open exact root and transfer one valid handle once
  + [common_3] query FileIdInfo
  + [branch_point] call GetFinalPathNameByHandleW with normalized volume-GUID flags
  + [local_branch] on final-path success, strict-decode path, call GetVolumeInformationByHandleW, strict-decode volume, and return CompleteLocal
  + [local_noncall] FileRemoteProtocolInfo is not called
  + [remote_branch] on actual nonzero final-path OS failure, call FileRemoteProtocolInfo on the same handle
  + [remote_success] nonzero protocol and zero reserved fields return CompleteRemote
  + [remote_protocol_zero] returns ObservationFault InvalidObservation at RemoteProtocolInformation
  + [remote_failure] returns QueryFault RemoteProtocolInformation with actual nonzero error
  + [final_path_error] is branch evidence only and is not emitted as partial evidence after remote query

& [SeamContract] is unchanged
  + [unsafe_blocks] is exactly six
  + [SAFETY_comments] is exactly six
  + [owner] is one OwnedHandle
  + [calls] are unchanged
  + [remote_block] is conditional
  + [access_flags_buffers_errors] remain those of the prior canonical
  + [new_dependency_or_effect] is zero

